00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
What do you see when you look at me?

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
The Equalizer is a thriller, action, crime film directed by Antoine Fuqua.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
McCall believes he has put his mysterious past behind him and
dedicated himself to beginning a new, quiet life.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
But when he meets Teri, a young girl under the control of ultra-violent
Russian gangsters, he can’t stand idly by – he has to help her.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Armed with hidden skills that allow him to serve vengeance against anyone who would brutalize the helpless,
McCall comes out of his self-imposed retirement and finds his desire for justice reawakened.

6
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
If someone has a problem, if the odds are stacked against them, if
they have nowhere else to turn, McCall will help.

7
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
He is The Equalizer.

8
